---
description: Superpowers — implementation plans under docs/plans require executing-plans / writing-plans discipline
globs: ["**/docs/plans/**/*.md", "**/AGENTS.md"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# Plans and Superpowers

When the user references or edits an implementation plan under `docs/plans/` (or asks to **execute** a plan):

1. **Read** `skills/executing-plans/SKILL.md` before batch execution (checkbox updates `[ ]` → `[~]` → `[x]`, verifications, **finishing-a-development-branch** when done).
2. **Read** `skills/writing-plans/SKILL.md` when creating or restructuring plan tasks.
3. If the plan text requires it, **Read** `skills/subagent-driven-development/SKILL.md` for per-task subagent flow.

Use the **Read** tool on those paths in the Superpowers plugin or workspace fork—Cursor has no `Skill` tool.
